OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with light showers feeding in
OL,7,Ffrom the North Sea, these become more
OL,8,Fisolated later in the night with the
OL,9,Fodd clearer spell developing. Light
OL,10,Fwinds but breezier around the coast.
OL,11,FCool overnight away from the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FCloudy to start with isolated
OL,14,Fshowers. Cloud breaks and showers ease
OL,15,Fto leave a fine afternoon. Light winds
OL,16,Fbut remaining breezier around the
OL,17,Fcoast. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
