OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,7,Fcoming days, bringing generally cloudy
OL,8,Fconditions with occasional showers,
OL,9,Fand a gentle easterly breeze.
OL,10,FTemperatures remain around normal for
OL,11,Fthe time of year.
